lizer/index.html), [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/styles.css), [app.js](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app.js))**:\\n     - **Panel A (Code Editor — Left)**: Python syntax highlighting, line numbers, editable code, `Load Example`, `Edit Code`, `Reset`, `Analyze Code`, and distinct highlighting for Current (`▶`), Executed (`✓`), Next (`↳`), and Upcoming lines.\\n     - **Panel B (Execution Visualizer — Center)**: Algorithm purpose & summary, step metrics, operation breakdown, condition/return outcome, \n<truncated 2359 bytes>","Description":"\"Create README.md with complete architecture, Windows startup instructions, and testing commands\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CVT\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\code-flow-visualizer\\\\README.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating documentation file README.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Create README.md with Windows setup and test instructions\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
